          <b>Date:</b> March 16, 1985<br/>
          <b>Venue:</b> Moscone Center, San Francisco, CA<br/>
          <b>Significance:</b> 20th anniversary celebration in San Francisco. Special hometown show marking two decades.<br/>
          <b>Era:</b> Anniversary Tour
